  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThis recipe was inspired by scenes from memories, softly bathed in pale, gentle light. It creates soft, delicate colors for capturing moments that move you, from everyday life and travel to the changing seasons, flowers, nature, and people. With a slightly hazy quality, it pairs beautifully with cool-toned scenes, natural greens, and skin tones. Even familiar surroundings can feel a little more special when captured in colors you love. This recipe was created with the hope to inspire a certain way of enjoying photography.",
